;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="200" y="350"/><mxPoint x="200" y="738"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="measure invalid (TODO)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#C0392B;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="125" y="150"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="루프 게이트 (FSM 밖, D-21 추가 7)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;skill_node 가 event NUDGE 를 쏘면&lt;br&gt;run_loop 가 다음 요청 전에 멈추고&lt;br&gt;state.mode = PAUSED(note=&quot;NUDGE&quot;) 발행,&lt;br&gt;두 번째 NUDGE 로 재개.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;인터락 중·계량 대기 중에만 감지된다&lt;br&gt;(블로킹 movel 중은 두산 충돌 감지 담당)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#5F6980;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="120" width="300" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="일탈 정책 (deviation.py)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;GRIP_FAIL      3회 RETRY → FORCED&lt;br&gt;SCOOP_EMPTY   3회 RETRY → REFILL&lt;br&gt;MATERIAL_EMPTY  즉시 REFILL&lt;br&gt;OVERFILL / TIMEOUT  즉시 QA&lt;br&gt;WEIGH_INVALID  2회 RETRY → QA&lt;br&gt;SLIP 2 · SAFETY_SWITCH 1 · FORCE_LIMIT 1 → FORCED&lt;br&gt;WRONG_TOOL [v1.2]  즉시 QA&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;count = 같은 배치·같은 스텝·같은 kind" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#5F6980;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="300" width="300" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="범례   파랑 = 정상 경로   주황 = 일탈·재시도   청록 = 복구·완료   빨강 = 강제 개입·폐기(종료)   회색 = 대기·재계량&lt;br&gt;전이표 밖 조합은 on_result 가 RuntimeError(&quot;전이 없음&quot;) 를 던진다 — 새 상태·kind 를 넣으면 전이와 테스트(test_process_fsm.py)를 같이 넣는다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#5F6980;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="860" width="1560" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="3 요청↔스킬 번역 (_execute)" name="3 요청↔스킬 번역 (_execute)"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="process_node._execute — FSM 요청 kind → 스킬 호출 → 결과 dict" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#161B2A;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1560" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="kind" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#161B2A;strokeColor=#161B2A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="160" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="요청 필드" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#161B2A;strokeColor=#161B2A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="90" width="260" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="노드가 부르는 스킬 (skill_node)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#161B2A;strokeColor=#161B2A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460"