"760" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="{'decision': APPROVED|DISCARDED}" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBEBDD;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#161B2A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="498" width="380" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="wait_interlock" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBEBDD;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#161B2A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="542" width="160" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="—" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBEBDD;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#161B2A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="542" width="260" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="스킬 없음 — _interlock_exit.clear(); wait()" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBEBDD;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#161B2A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="542" width="760" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="{}" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBEBDD;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#161B2A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="542" width="380" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="_call_action(client, goal) 보조 함수 하나로 통일&lt;br&gt;  1) client.wait_for_server(5 s)   2) send_goal_async → goal_handle   3) get_result_async → Future&lt;br&gt;  4) Event 로 동기 대기 (run_loop 는 executor 스레드가 아니므로 spin 하지 말 것 — MultiThreadedExecutor 가 콜백을 돌린다)&lt;br&gt;  5) 인터락 ENTER 가 오면 goal_handle.cancel_goal_async()  → 취소 결과 후 safe_pose&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;실패(success=false)는 표에 없다 → FORCE_LIMIT 일탈로 _deviate(RETRY 1회 → FORCED) 권장" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#5F6980;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="616" width="760" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="발행 시점&lt;br&gt;  weight            weigh 결과마다 (TARE 포함)&lt;br&gt;  dispense_result   원료가 끝날 때 — WEIGH 에서 DONE 또는 DEVIATION 으로 갈 때&lt;br&gt;  deviation         _deviate() 마다 (fsm.deviations 길이 증가 감지) + QA 판정 후 decision·operator_id 채워 같은 deviation_id 로 재발행&lt;br&gt;  event             BATCH_START(product) · STEP(전이) · INTERLOCK_ENTER/EXIT · INTERVENTION_FORCED(ERROR) · BATCH_END&lt;br&gt;  state             0.5 s 타이머 + 전이 직후 1회" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#5F6980;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="616" width="780" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>